# Customer-success churn triage based on engagement, value, and renewal risk.
decisiontree "Customer Churn Triage"
q "Is the renewal within 90 days?"
  yes: q "Has product usage declined for four weeks?"
    yes: q "Is an executive sponsor engaged?"
      yes: a "Run sponsor recovery plan"
      no: a "Escalate executive outreach"
    no: a "Confirm value and renewal plan"
  no: q "Is customer health score below 60?"
    yes: q "Is there an unresolved critical issue?"
      yes: a "Assign incident and success leadership"
      no: a "Schedule proactive success review"
    no: a "Continue standard success cadence"
